character deaths I suffer are due to various traps:
1) Magic traps ('you are blinded by a blast of light' 'it hits' it hits'
   'it hits' 'you die'. Logfile lists: an iguana)
2) Trap doors dumping me into monster-infested areas without a chance
   to escape (Logfile lists: hill orc)
3) Polymorph traps ('gnome deliberately steps on the polymorph trap' 'red
   dragon breathes fire' 'you are hit by a blast of fire' 'you die'. Logfile
   lists: red dragon).
So a trap should be listed as one of most deadly monsters for a low-level
character...
